---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy | DevOps4Solutions" description="Privacy Policy, Terms of Use, and Disclaimer for DevOps4Solutions.">
  <Container className="py-14">
    <div class="card p-6 sm:p-8 prose-content">
      <h1 class="mt-0 mb-10 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Privacy Policy</h1>
      
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> July 11, 2026</p>

      <p>At <strong>DevOps4Solutions</strong>, we value your privacy.</p>
      <p>We may collect basic information such as your name and email address when you contact us or subscribe to updates. We also use standard website analytics and cookies to understand how visitors use the site and to improve your experience.</p>
      <p>Any information you provide is used only to communicate with you or improve our content. We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      <p>This website may include embedded content (such as YouTube videos) and links to third-party websites, which are governed by their own privacy policies.</p>
      <p>By using this website, you agree to this Privacy Policy. We may update this policy from time to time, and any changes will be reflected on this page.</p>
      <p>If you have any questions, please contact us through the <a href="/contact.html">Contact page</a>.</p>

      <h1 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-950">Terms of Use</h1>
      
      <p>By accessing this website, you agree to these Terms of Use.</p>

      <h3>Educational Purpose</h3>
      <p>All content published on this website is provided for educational and informational purposes only. While every effort is made to provide accurate and current information, no guarantee is made regarding the completeness, accuracy, or reliability of any content.</p>

      <h3>No Professional Advice</h3>
      <p>The information provided does not constitute legal, financial, security, compliance, or professional consulting advice.</p>
      <p>Always evaluate recommendations within your own organization's requirements before implementing them in production environments.</p>

      <h3>External Resources</h3>
      <p>Links to external websites are provided for convenience only. We do not endorse or guarantee the information available on third-party websites.</p>

      <h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>
      <p>Under no circumstances shall DevOps4Solutions be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use of this website or the implementation of information published on it. Use all scripts, code samples, infrastructure templates, and tutorials at your own risk.</p>

      <h3>Changes</h3>
      <p>These Terms may be updated periodically without prior notice.</p>

      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The opinions expressed on this website are my own and do not represent the views of my current or previous employers, clients, or business partners. Technical articles, architecture diagrams, scripts, Terraform examples, Kubernetes manifests, AWS configurations, and DevOps tutorials are provided for educational purposes only.</p>
      <p>Every organization has different security, compliance, networking, governance, and operational requirements. Always validate any implementation before deploying it into production.</p>
      <p>Although I strive to keep all content accurate and current, cloud platforms and technologies evolve rapidly. Some information may become outdated over time.</p>
      <p>Product names, trademarks, and company names mentioned on this website belong to their respective owners.</p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
